// Weapon icons over players' heads (sprite TPWI, frames A-S; the table is in zscript.zs,
// BuildWeaponIcons). Each one points at the weapon's own pickup picture, cut to the picture,
// anchored at its bottom middle and scaled so its longer side is 28 units. The mod's LZS and
// Pib card have no picture of their own, so those two are in graphics/.

